{%- comment -%}
  Not used in any template's JSON on purpose. The Section Rendering API lets
  any section be fetched from any URL via ?section_id=product-card-render,
  which is how theme.js's recently-viewed feature gets a fresh, real card for
  a product the shopper looked at earlier, straight from that product's own
  page - so price, availability and the sold badge are never stale.
{%- endcomment -%}
{% render 'product-card', product: product %}
{% schema %}
{ "name": "Product card (fetch)" }
{% endschema %}
